     5468   main-block:
     5469   do
     5470   on error  undo main-block, return error substitute( "&1. &2&3&4", vss-workfile, return-value, chr(10), error-status :get-message (1))
     5471   on stop   undo main-block, return error substitute( "&1. stop", vss-workfile )
     5472   on endkey undo main-block, return error substitute( "&1. endkey", vss-workfile )
     5473   :
